exports[`CostStructureModal: parámetros, plantilla e importación > importar una hoja en la estructura propia reemplaza las filas y registra la bitácora 1`] = `"<div class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/50 flex items-center justify-center z-50 p-4"><div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-xl w-full max-w-5xl max-h-[92vh] overflow-y-auto"><div class="sticky top-0 bg-white flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 z-10"><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800">Estructura de costos — Transportes Uno</h2><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Los gastos de operar un viaje de esta flota propia. Se acumulan y es lo que se liquida y se envía a cuentas por pagar.</p></div><button class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 cursor-pointer" aria-label="Cerrar"><i class="ri-close-line text-xl"></i></button></div><div class="px-6 py-5 space-y-5"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 items-end"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_3m_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Nombre</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_3m_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " value="Costos de flota propia — por defecto (VE) (propia)"></div></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_3n_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Días operativos por mes</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_3n_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " type="number" value="30"></div></div><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm "><i class="ri-save-line mr-1"></i> Guardar parámetros</button></div><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 -mt-3">Los días operativos son el divisor de los conceptos <strong>mensuales</strong>: un salario mensual se reparte entre ellos y se cobran los días que dura el viaje.</p><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 -mt-3">Parámetros de la plantilla: km por año <strong>—</strong> · combustible (VES) <strong>—</strong> · rendimiento km/l <strong>—</strong>. Se cambian subiendo la plantilla.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 border-y border-slate-100 py-3"><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-700 text-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md px-4 py-2 text-sm "><i class="ri-file-upload-line mr-1"></i> Subir plantilla</button><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm "><i class="ri-download-2-line mr-1"></i> Descargar plantilla</button><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm "><i class="ri-file-excel-2-line mr-1"></i> Importar una hoja suelta</button><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 basis-full">La plantilla reemplaza toda la estructura de esta compañía. La hoja suelta agrega o reemplaza conceptos de un solo tipo de cobro (por ejemplo, una lista de importes fijos).</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-6 gap-2 items-end bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-3"><div class="md:col-span-2"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_3o_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Concepto</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_3o_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="Salario del chofer" value=""></div></div></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_3p_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Cómo se cobra</label><select id="_r_3p_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="FIXED">Fijo por viaje</option><option value="PER_KM">Por kilómetro</option><option value="PER_DAY">Por día de viaje</option><option value="PER_MONTH_PRORATED">Mensual (prorrateado por día)</option><option value="PER_CLIENT">Por parada/cliente</option><option value="PER_HOUR">Por hora</option><option value="custom:horas_espera">Horas de espera (variable de la compañía)</option><option value="custom:incidencias">Incidencias (variable de la compañía)</option><option value="custom:minutos_atraso">Minutos de atraso (variable de la compañía)</option><option value="custom:monto_peajes">Monto de peajes (variable de la compañía)</option><option value="custom:recolectas">Recolectas (variable de la compañía)</option></select></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_3q_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Importe (VES)</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_3q_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " value="0"></div></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_3r_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Efecto</label><select id="_r_3r_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-